  "articleBody": "Interior remodeling is easiest to control when the scope, layout, materials, permits, and construction responsibilities are defined before work begins. For San Diego County homeowners, the right provider should connect design decisions with existing conditions, coordinate required trade work, explain permitting, and give you a detailed written agreement covering cost, payments, materials, schedule, and changes.",
